gametitle=Ape Escape 3 (EXAMPLE - DO NOT INSTALL) [SCUS-97501]
// co-op split screen with Kei and Yumi -- built by aecoops
// disc CRC 00000000 (this is the name PCSX2 looks for in cheats/)
// THIS IS A FORMAT EXAMPLE, NOT A WORKING PATCH.
// Its addresses are made up (a fake hook site, a fake cave, fake entry addresses).
// Generate your own with:
//   aecoops export-pnach --out patches/<CRC>.pnach --hud shared --p1 kei --p2 yumi
// which reads the hook site, the free RAM and the whole write list out of your running game.
// co-op split screen: player one kei, player two yumi, vertical split, per-view HUD. EXAMPLE ONLY: the addresses are made up. Build your own with `aecoops export-pnach`.
// the interpreter is written into unused RAM, then one jal in the game's per-frame path is redirected into it

